ia-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(18)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1339/202001081901222250949.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4/5 \" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC Mag\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4/5 </p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      A Solid Alternative to the GT-AX11000 Pro\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>03/07/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 Media review Award of 4/5 \" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://uk.pcmag.com/routers/96497/the-best-gaming-routers-for-2020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1332/202304151929169780517.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Router of 2023 - Winner\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      NXT\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Router of 2023 - Winner</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The powerful hardware, including a 2.0 Ghz quad-core 64-bit CPU and WiFi chipsets, enhances network throughput by up to 18%.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SINGAPORE</span> <span>01/01/2024</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 Media review Award of Router of 2023 - Winner\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://nxtmag.tech/2023/12/01/nxt-gadget-awards-2023-voting/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202302011538163660717.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hardwareinside High-End Recommendation \" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hardwareinside.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hardwareinside High-End Recommendation </p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The speed in all networks is outstanding and leaves no room for criticism. The abundance of useful features and the very well-functioning app also speak for the Asus model. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>01/31/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 Media review Award of Hardwareinside High-End Recommendation \" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwareinside.de/asus-rog-rapture-gt-axe16000-im-test-71917/#Fazit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202007301703276980072.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"9 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Frandroid\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>9 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It's hard to find any complain about the Asus ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 router. The newcomer in the Asus range offers excellent performance and above all particularly complete features. It can easily replace the box of your operator while offering advanced functions particularly welcome.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>10/01/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 Media review Award of 9 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.frandroid.com/marques/asus/1485338_test-asus-rog-rapture-gt-axe16000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001102126564770077.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Guru3d\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If you're looking to upgrade to the fastest Wi-Fi 6E router on the market, the ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 is a great option.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>02/17/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.guru3d.com/articles-pages/asus-rog-rapture-gt-axe16000-wifi6e-router-review,1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1225/202009301338063180001.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"TechRadars Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Tech Radar\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>TechRadars Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 is Asus’ latest attempt to defeat itself in the race to build the ultimate gaming router. And it’s succeeded. This router offers bleeding-edge connectivity that can’t be surpassed without opting for industrial equipment. It also looks phenomenal and is laden with every consumer feature you could want... plus some specialist gaming ones. However, it’s expensive and likely overkill for most buyers.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>AUSTRALIA</span> <span>04/14/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Rapture GT-AXE16000 Media review Award of TechRadars Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/reviews/asus-rog-rapture-gt-axe16000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=